{"event": "phase_output", "ts": 1781460777.4373195, "iso": "2026-06-14T18:12:57.437322+00:00", "phase": 0, "line": "### Alert: I-003 (Dual AIS Position)", "line_type": "output"}
{"event": "phase_output", "ts": 1781460777.4413223, "iso": "2026-06-14T18:12:57.441325+00:00", "phase": 0, "line": "**Triage Steps:**", "line_type": "output"}
{"event": "phase_output", "ts": 1781460777.445282, "iso": "2026-06-14T18:12:57.445285+00:00", "phase": 0, "line": "1. Open VesselFinder/MarineTraffic \u2014 search MMSI 276012370", "line_type": "output"}
{"event": "phase_output", "ts": 1781460777.4495273, "iso": "2026-06-14T18:12:57.449530+00:00", "phase": 0, "line": "2. Compare reported positions: is one position Tallinn Old Harbor? Where is the other?", "line_type": "output"}
{"event": "phase_output", "ts": 1781460777.4534943, "iso": "2026-06-14T18:12:57.453497+00:00", "phase": 0, "line": "3. Check AIS signal source: T-AIS (terrestrial) or S-AIS (satellite)?", "line_type": "output"}
{"event": "phase_output", "ts": 1781460777.4577923, "iso": "2026-06-14T18:12:57.457795+00:00", "phase": 0, "line": "4. If both positions are recent (<1 hour), flag as probable spoofing event", "line_type": "output"}
{"event": "phase_output", "ts": 1781460777.462085, "iso": "2026-06-14T18:12:57.462088+00:00", "phase": 0, "line": "5. Log incident in M-SOC case management", "line_type": "output"}
{"event": "phase_output", "ts": 1781460777.466291, "iso": "2026-06-14T18:12:57.466294+00:00", "phase": 0, "line": "**Escalation:**", "line_type": "output"}
{"event": "phase_output", "ts": 1781460777.4702916, "iso": "2026-06-14T18:12:57.470295+00:00", "phase": 0, "line": "- If dual position persists >1 hour \u2192 Notify Estonian Transport Administration (maritime security desk)", "line_type": "output"}
{"event": "phase_output", "ts": 1781460777.4755108, "iso": "2026-06-14T18:12:57.475514+00:00", "phase": 0, "line": "- If spoofed position is near critical infrastructure \u2192 Notify Navy / Coast Guard", "line_type": "output"}
{"event": "phase_output", "ts": 1781460777.4791968, "iso": "2026-06-14T18:12:57.479199+00:00", "phase": 0, "line": "### Alert: I-005 (GPS Anomaly)", "line_type": "output"}
{"event": "phase_output", "ts": 1781460777.4822774, "iso": "2026-06-14T18:12:57.482280+00:00", "phase": 0, "line": "**Triage Steps:**", "line_type": "output"}
{"event": "phase_output", "ts": 1781460777.4853914, "iso": "2026-06-14T18:12:57.485394+00:00", "phase": 0, "line": "1. Confirm GPS loss is vessel-specific or area-wide (check other AIS targets in Tallinn harbor)", "line_type": "output"}
{"event": "phase_output", "ts": 1781460777.488456, "iso": "2026-06-14T18:12:57.488458+00:00", "phase": 0, "line": "2. If area-wide: possible GPS jamming event", "line_type": "output"}
{"event": "phase_output", "ts": 1781460777.4914079, "iso": "2026-06-14T18:12:57.491410+00:00", "phase": 0, "line": "3. Check GPS.GOV status page for scheduled maintenance", "line_type": "output"}
{"event": "phase_output", "ts": 1781460777.4943945, "iso": "2026-06-14T18:12:57.494397+00:00", "phase": 0, "line": "4. Cross-reference with known jamming events in the Baltic region", "line_type": "output"}
{"event": "phase_output", "ts": 1781460777.4973328, "iso": "2026-06-14T18:12:57.497335+00:00", "phase": 0, "line": "5. Note duration and affected frequencies", "line_type": "output"}
{"event": "phase_output", "ts": 1781460777.5004723, "iso": "2026-06-14T18:12:57.500474+00:00", "phase": 0, "line": "**Escalation:**", "line_type": "output"}
{"event": "phase_output", "ts": 1781460777.503482, "iso": "2026-06-14T18:12:57.503484+00:00", "phase": 0, "line": "- If GPS loss >30 minutes across multiple vessels \u2192 Report to Estonian Spectrum Authority", "line_type": "output"}
{"event": "phase_output", "ts": 1781460777.5064473, "iso": "2026-06-14T18:12:57.506449+00:00", "phase": 0, "line": "- If GPS loss coincides with AIS spoofing \u2192 Priority 1 \u2014 potential coordinated attack", "line_type": "output"}
{"event": "phase_output", "ts": 1781460777.509489, "iso": "2026-06-14T18:12:57.509491+00:00", "phase": 0, "line": "### Alert: I-001 / I-002 (Physical Security)", "line_type": "output"}
{"event": "phase_output", "ts": 1781460777.5125952, "iso": "2026-06-14T18:12:57.512597+00:00", "phase": 0, "line": "**Triage Steps:**", "line_type": "output"}
{"event": "phase_output", "ts": 1781460777.5156572, "iso": "2026-06-14T18:12:57.515659+00:00", "phase": 0, "line": "1. Review harbor CCTV footage for time windows", "line_type": "output"}
{"event": "phase_output", "ts": 1781460777.5186443, "iso": "2026-06-14T18:12:57.518646+00:00", "phase": 0, "line": "2. Contact Tallinn Old Harbor security / port authority", "line_type": "output"}
{"event": "phase_output", "ts": 1781460777.5217729, "iso": "2026-06-14T18:12:57.521775+00:00", "phase": 0, "line": "3. Contact vessel owner (via port registry)", "line_type": "output"}
{"event": "phase_output", "ts": 1781460777.5246274, "iso": "2026-06-14T18:12:57.524630+00:00", "phase": 0, "line": "4. Physical inspection of SILEGNA by harbor staff", "line_type": "output"}
{"event": "phase_output", "ts": 1781460777.5296955, "iso": "2026-06-14T18:12:57.529698+00:00", "phase": 0, "line": "**Escalation:**", "line_type": "output"}
{"event": "phase_output", "ts": 1781460777.5378013, "iso": "2026-06-14T18:12:57.537804+00:00", "phase": 0, "line": "- If forced entry confirmed \u2192 File police report (Estonia Police and Border Guard Board)", "line_type": "output"}
{"event": "phase_output", "ts": 1781460777.5419164, "iso": "2026-06-14T18:12:57.541919+00:00", "phase": 0, "line": "- If equipment stolen \u2192 Provide MMSI, call sign, and stolen equipment serial numbers to police", "line_type": "output"}
{"event": "phase_output", "ts": 1781460777.5473523, "iso": "2026-06-14T18:12:57.547355+00:00", "phase": 0, "line": "---", "line_type": "output"}
{"event": "phase_output", "ts": 1781460777.5512972, "iso": "2026-06-14T18:12:57.551300+00:00", "phase": 0, "line": "## Detection Engineering Notes", "line_type": "output"}
{"event": "phase_output", "ts": 1781460777.5544236, "iso": "2026-06-14T18:12:57.554426+00:00", "phase": 0, "line": "1. **No Elastic, Zeek, or Wazuh rules are deployable on SILEGNA itself** \u2014 the vessel has no network, no server, no endpoint. Any monitoring must be external (harbor CCTV, AIS base stations, RF spectrum monitoring).", "line_type": "output"}
{"event": "phase_output", "ts": 1781460777.5574856, "iso": "2026-06-14T18:12:57.557488+00:00", "phase": 0, "line": "2. **For AIS base station operators in Tallinn:** Configure alerts when MMSI 276012370 position changes while vessel is flagged as \"in port\" with 0 kn speed. AIS positional drift of >50 m while moored is suspicious (may indicate spoofing or AIS transponder tampering).", "line_type": "output"}
{"event": "phase_output", "ts": 1781460777.5605984, "iso": "2026-06-14T18:12:57.560601+00:00", "phase": 0, "line": "3. **GPS jamming detection** should be integrated into the Tallinn Port Authority's navigation safety monitoring, not a vessel-level control.", "line_type": "output"}
{"event": "phase_output", "ts": 1781460777.56369, "iso": "2026-06-14T18:12:57.563692+00:00", "phase": 0, "line": "---", "line_type": "output"}
{"event": "phase_output", "ts": 1781460777.5666678, "iso": "2026-06-14T18:12:57.566670+00:00", "phase": 0, "line": "## Grafana Dashboard: Tallinn Harbor Maritime Health", "line_type": "output"}
